{"t":"Chakoya Iceberg","s":"chakoya-iceberg-d9db0","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Windcaller_d44ed7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Chakoya Iceberg</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Chakoya Windcaller\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Windcaller_d44ed7.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North-west in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32623,32584,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32623, 32584, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Chakoya Iceberg</b> is an iceberg which floats around Tibia and is sometimes reachable from the north-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32623,32584,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32623, 32584, 7)</a>. It can only be reached when the connected Mini World Change is active.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoyas\">Chakoyas</a> which inhabit this iceberg have no choice but to serve the single <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Giantess\">Frost Giantess</a> on top of it, as becomes clear from a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Note Pinned on the Wall\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Note_Pinned_on_the_Wall_b65fb0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Note Pinned on the Wall next to some food which says:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiagreen\">Important for all shamanic apprentices! Never forget sacrifice for Great Frost Giantess! If Great Frost Giantess does not get enough food, Great Frost Giantess will feed on little Chakoyas!</span>\n</p><p>Explorer Wilmot Dustheart saw this iceberg and accessed it to find out why it had stranded in such a strange place. After writing down his discoveries in his journal, he froze to death.\n</p><p>The Chakoya Iceberg is one of the spots you have to cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Toolshaper\"><img alt=\"Chakoya Toolshaper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chakoya_Toolshaper_b64052.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Chakoya%20Toolshaper\">Chakoya Toolshaper</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">40</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">80</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">80 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wik