>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Helmet\">Dark Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shard\">Shard</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Norse Shield (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["chakoya-iceberg-mini-world-change"]}